{"page":135,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:60","surah":6,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم بِٱلَّيْلِ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا جَرَحْتُم بِٱلنَّهَارِ ثُمَّ يَبْعَثُكُمْ فِيهِ لِيُقْضَىٰٓ أَجَلٌ مُّسَمًّى ۖ ثُمَّ إِلَيْهِ مَرْجِعُكُمْ ثُمَّ يُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who calls your souls back by night, knowing what you have done by day, then raises you up again in the daytime until your fixed term is fulfilled. It is to Him that you will return in the end, and He will tell you what you have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","en_gloss":"takes your (soul)","transliteration":"yatawaffākum","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"by the night","transliteration":"bi-al-layli","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"and He knows","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَرَحْتُم","en_gloss":"you committed","transliteration":"jaraḥtum","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"by the day","transliteration":"bil-nahāri","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَبْعَثُكُمْ","en_gloss":"He raises you up","transliteration":"yabʿathukum","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"so that is fulfilled","transliteration":"liyuq'ḍā","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَجَلٌۭ","en_gloss":"(the) term","transliteration":"ajalun","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۖ","en_gloss":"specified","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"6:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss"