","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَحَدَكُمُ","en_gloss":"(to) anyone of you","transliteration":"aḥadakumu","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","en_gloss":"the death","transliteration":"l-mawtu","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَوَفَّتْهُ","en_gloss":"take him","transliteration":"tawaffathu","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رُسُلُنَا","en_gloss":"Our messengers","transliteration":"rusulunā","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يُفَرِّطُونَ","en_gloss":"fail","transliteration":"yufarriṭūna","verse_key":"6:61"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:61"}]},{"verse_key":"6:62","surah":6,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ رُدُّوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ مَوْلَىٰهُمُ ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ أَلَا لَهُ ٱلْحُكْمُ وَهُوَ أَسْرَعُ ٱلْحَـٰسِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then they will all be returned to God, their true Lord. The Judgement truly belongs to Him, and He is the swiftest of reckoners.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رُدُّوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they are returned","transliteration":"ruddū","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَوْلَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"their Protector ","transliteration":"mawlāhumu","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] True","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Unquestionably","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"6:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"